Package: simvec
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Local Vector Search Engine Binding
Description: Thin R binding over the simvec C API (bring your own
    libsimvec). Covers collections, writes, payloads, transactions,
    retrieval, maintenance, and engine default configs with the same
    semantics as the Python, JavaScript, and Go bindings.
Authors@R: person("simvec contributors", email = "simvec-maintainers@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
License: Apache-2.0
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite
SystemRequirements: C toolchain; libsimvec built with the c_api feature
